# Detection 5: Rare Process by Parent (Anomaly Hunt)
# MITRE ATT&CK: Multi-technique (anomaly-based)
# Data Source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Process Creation)
#
# Logic: Identify executables observed fewer than 3 times in the
# search window. Most environments have a long tail of rare binaries
# that warrant human review - ad-hoc tools, one-off scripts, and
# occasionally malware. This is a hunting query rather than a
# precision-tuned alert.
#
# Usage: Run on demand as a hunting tool, not as a scheduled alert.
# The values(ParentImage) field lets the analyst pivot quickly to the
# parent process to assess whether the chain looks legitimate.

index=main sourcetype=xmlwineventlog EventCode=1
| stats count, values(ParentImage) AS parents by Image
| where count < 3
| sort count